2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Piecewise\055parabolic\040methods\040for\040astrophysical\040fluid\040dynamics)
/Author (Paul\040R\056\040Woodward)
/Subject (A\040general\040description\040of\040some\040modern\040numerical\040techniques\040for\040the\040simulation\040of\040astrophysical\040fluid\040flow\040is\040presented\040The\040methods\040are\040introduced\040with\040a\040thorough\040discussion\040of\040the\040especially\040simple\040case\040of\040advection\040Attention\040is\040focussed\040on\040the\040piecewise\055parabolic\040method\040\050PPM\051\040A\040description\040of\040the\040SLIC\040method\040for\040treating\040multifluid\040problems\040is\040also\040given\040The\040discussion\040is\040illustrated\040by\040a\040number\040of\040advection\040and\040hydrodynamics\040test\040problems\040Finally\054\040a\040study\040of\040Kelvin\055Helmholtz\040instability\040of\040supersonic\040jets\040using\040PPM\040with\040SLIC\040fluid\040interfaces\040is\040presented)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0401986\054\040Fluid\040mechanics\054\040Fluid\040dynamics\054\040Lawrence\040Livermore\040National\040Laboratory)
>>
endobj
